From 5526d4889e7193f1f1933ea4d4830fe0165e660d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tesseract XRT port <jwkim@limagin.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 11:13:52 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 10/19] xocl, xclmgmt: restore the crc32c_le alias (Linux 6.15)

The user PF stamps the shared mailbox page with crc32c_le(~0, ...) in
xocl_mb_connect() and the management PF recomputes it in
xclmgmt_is_same_domain(). Up to 6.14, <linux/crc32c.h> provided
"#define crc32c_le crc32c". Mainline commit 8df36829045a ("lib/crc32:
standardize on crc32c() name for Castagnoli CRC32", v6.15) dropped the
alias and reduced <linux/crc32c.h> to an include of <linux/crc32.h>,
which declares crc32c().

Guard: feature test "#ifndef crc32c_le" right after the include, so the
kernel's own alias is used wherever it still exists (6.8 .. 6.14) and
the identical alias is supplied where it was removed. Call sites are
unchanged.

Equivalence: exact. crc32c_le has been a plain alias of crc32c() since
long before 6.8; crc32c() is CRC-32C (Castagnoli, poly 0x82f63b78,
LSB first, no pre/post inversion) both in the 6.8 libcrc32c module
(raw shash state seeded with the caller's value) and in the 6.15+ CRC
library, so both ends compute the same value as before, also when one
side runs an older kernel (VM passthrough setups).

Upstream: XRT commit f41db917c replaces the call with crc32_le() on
6.13+, which is the IEEE CRC-32, a different checksum; mixing it with
an older peer breaks the same-domain check. Not taken.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SpY5QiU1d7kAe8YJM35EvA
---
 driver/xocl/mgmtpf/mgmt-core.c | 4 ++++
 driver/xocl/userpf/xocl_drv.c  | 4 ++++
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/driver/xocl/mgmtpf/mgmt-core.c b/driver/xocl/mgmtpf/mgmt-core.c
index 704fa9b..f7548fa 100644
--- a/driver/xocl/mgmtpf/mgmt-core.c
+++ b/driver/xocl/mgmtpf/mgmt-core.c
@@ -13,6 +13,10 @@
 #include "mgmt-core.h"
 
 #include <linux/crc32c.h>
+#ifndef crc32c_le
+/* the crc32c_le alias of crc32c() was removed in 6.15 (commit 8df36829045a) */
+#define crc32c_le crc32c
+#endif
 #include <linux/fs.h>
 #include <linux/ioctl.h>
 #include <linux/i2c.h>
diff --git a/driver/xocl/userpf/xocl_drv.c b/driver/xocl/userpf/xocl_drv.c
index 1988260..96d6d63 100644
--- a/driver/xocl/userpf/xocl_drv.c
+++ b/driver/xocl/userpf/xocl_drv.c
@@ -8,6 +8,10 @@
 
 #include <linux/aer.h>
 #include <linux/crc32c.h>
+#ifndef crc32c_le
+/* the crc32c_le alias of crc32c() was removed in 6.15 (commit 8df36829045a) */
+#define crc32c_le crc32c
+#endif
 #include <linux/iommu.h>
 #include <linux/kernel.h>
 #include <linux/module.h>
